						<h3>How much do WordPress SEO services cost?</h3>
						<p>A WordPress SEO and AI visibility audit runs $1,200 to $4,500 depending on site size, plugin count, and how many categories need prompt testing. Implementation and ongoing WordPress SEO run $1,500 to $7,000 per month based on scope. Everything is quoted after a look at your actual install, not a generic tier.</p>
